{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>&quot;It's hard for you to let go, isn't it?&quot;</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900160/extras/03a4e2ee4b3bd1967cd0c7e1f11c2ec3.avif?t=1758026729\" width=600 height=87 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Misdecayed is an adventure RPG about life, death, rebirth, and robots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900160/extras/0ce7269492b0e908d328fab3dab7effe.avif?t=1758026729\" width=268 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Misdecayed features turn-based combat and top-down exploration reminiscent of 90's era JRPG classics. Explore the colorful world of Forgebirth Island, and slowly you'll notice that things are starting to unravel beneath the surface...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900160/extras/a7ea0dd7655110d47ff280958b4d8518.poster.avif?t=1758026729\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900160/extras/a7ea0dd7655110d47ff280958b4d8518.webm?t=1758026729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900160/extras/a7ea0dd7655110d47ff280958b4d8518.mp4?t=1758026729\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>As you explore the island, you'll encounter a wide array of critters and creatures, both friendly and hostile, cute and frightening. Eternia says that fighting in this world is to be expected, but then, why do they feel so... odd...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900160/extras/55890238bfb269727f7389605de8bf25.avif?t=1758026729\" width=268 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Molly Alkaline died at age 23. Crushed in an earthquake that decimated her hometown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...and now, she finds herself face to face with Eternia, the seventh Soul Conductor of the Afterlife. And Molly is given a choice; to pass on in peace... or get a second chance. To be reborn as an &quot;Acclimator&quot;; a robotic shell housing her soul, to return to the world from which she came, and live a longer life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900160/extras/0d4e8cec1f490381c1b14a355945163f.avif?t=1758026729\" width=768 height=576 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And so, Molly returns. Arriving on the Forgebirth Island, her residence of choice, she meets another Acclimator, Ashie, who (despite their grumbling) has been assigned to help Molly complete her Acclimator duties.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...but...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...there's someone else here, too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900160/extras/37d19cd04f3fbd8bbe2931f90d9f3edd.avif?t=1758026729\" width=268 height=64 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow Molly and her new friends' journey to uncover the hidden history of Forgebirth Island in a race against time to save its fate.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle a wide variety of formidable foes as you dive into the mysteries of the island and what's causing it to decay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An entirely new universe and cast from the director of<i> vivid/stasis</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five chapters and 10-15 hours of character-focused dungeon-crawling RPG fun.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An entirely custom soundtrack by A-Saph, mrcool909090, and Cheryl Stelli.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gorgeous custom visuals by SoftySapphie and Uni.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>&quot;Are you prepared to say goodbye for good?&quot;</i></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3900160?t=1758026729","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900160/c7c94523019828b90ddce623ef8b5acbaa8047f2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758026729","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900160/1ee5ac30fd368d3337f71494a8724a4f8d7f9711/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758026729","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900160/1ee5ac30fd368d3337f71494a8724a4f8d7f9711/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758026729","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Misdecayed is a story about death and some of the ways we can depart this world unnaturally. As such, it deals in topics of the deaths of younger people, including by suicide.\r\n\r\nAlso note that some sensitive content may not be present until later chapters in the game."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>&quot;It's hard for you to let go, isn't it?&quot;</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900160/extras/03a4e2ee4b3bd1967cd0c7e1f11c2ec3.avif?t=1758026729\" width=600 height=87 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Misdecayed is an adventure RPG about life, death, rebirth, and robots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900160/extras/0ce7269492b0e908d328fab3dab7effe.avif?t=1758026729\" width=268 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Misdecayed features turn-based combat and top-down exploration reminiscent of 90's era JRPG classics. Explore the colorful world of Forgebirth Island, and slowly you'll notice that things are starting to unravel beneath the surface...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900160/extras/a7ea0dd7655110d47ff280958b4d8518.poster.avif?t=1758026729\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900160/extras/a7ea0dd7655110d47ff280958b4d8518.webm?t=1758026729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900160/extras/a7ea0dd7655110d47ff280958b4d8518.mp4?t=1758026729\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>As you explore the island, you'll encounter a wide array of critters and creatures, both friendly and hostile, cute and frightening. Eternia says that fighting in this world is to be expected, but then, why do they feel so... odd...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900160/extras/55890238bfb269727f7389605de8bf25.avif?t=1758026729\" width=268 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Molly Alkaline died at age 23. Crushed in an earthquake that decimated her hometown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...and now, she finds herself face to face with Eternia, the seventh Soul Conductor of the Afterlife. And Molly is given a choice; to pass on in peace... or get a second chance. To be reborn as an &quot;Acclimator&quot;; a robotic shell housing her soul, to return to the world from which she came, and live a longer life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900160/extras/0d4e8cec1f490381c1b14a355945163f.avif?t=1758026729\" width=768 height=576 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And so, Molly returns. Arriving on the Forgebirth Island, her residence of choice, she meets another Acclimator, Ashie, who (despite their grumbling) has been assigned to help Molly complete her Acclimator duties.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...but...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...there's someone else here, too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900160/extras/37d19cd04f3fbd8bbe2931f90d9f3edd.avif?t=1758026729\" width=268 height=64 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow Molly and her new friends' journey to uncover the hidden history of Forgebirth Island in a race against time to save its fate.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle a wide variety of formidable foes as you dive into the mysteries of the island and what's causing it to decay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An entirely new universe and cast from the director of<i> vivid/stasis</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five chapters and 10-15 hours of character-focused dungeon-crawling RPG fun.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An entirely custom soundtrack by A-Saph, mrcool909090, and Cheryl Stelli.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gorgeous custom visuals by SoftySapphie and Uni.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>&quot;Are you prepared to say goodbye for good?&quot;</i></h2>","developers":["Hajimeli"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_i